{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：16:14 2026-08-22 HKT<br/>發佈時間：16:14 2026-08-22 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：16:14 2026-08-22 HKT</p><p>尚有兩周新馬季便正式開鑼，近期陸續有馬房進行拜神儀式。今天為黃道吉日，呂健威、告東尼、賀賢和桂福特馬房均舉行季前馬房拜神儀式，沙田及奥運馬房同樣熱鬧。<br/> <br/>華人冠軍級練馬師呂健威今午舉行馬房季前拜神儀式，多位馬主出席，包括「興馳千里」馬主鄧銘興等；至於騎師方面，洋將有潘頓、奧爾民和希威森等出席；華將方面有周俊樂、潘明輝、梁家俊、楊明綸和巫顯東。</p><p>呂健威今午和往年一樣，沙田從化同步拜神。</p><h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2><img alt=\"蔣嘉琦（右）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b915285098ee9365835c9896fcbec514/2026-08/3ce9c27c-6133-4902-941c-66d48c074af6.jpg\"/><img alt=\"「威利澳爸」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e8f080d30def582dc88183a9fd169930/2026-08/7b58430e-0f73-45ce-b24e-5d1cb0d89e03.jpg\"/><img alt=\"副練薛練與從化視象同步拜神。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ad863d8b6cadafd2493dac63ea046637/2026-08/46fc02c8-cc6a-4c0e-8438-4df74958cd4d.jpg\"/><img alt=\"巫顯東一家\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/615512bda9587a4425b154dc1b24fe3a/2026-08/836cfd00-f11d-475f-8ede-a3002fd009d8.jpg\"/><img alt=\"「閃耀天河」馬主\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5c999fb3a6bab173e885f87bcdefef99/2026-08/88952d32-18e7-4603-a143-77fa806d7e1e.jpg\"/><img alt=\"潘明輝（左）與周俊樂\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/69bb540f0d8e48ed5184eded258069f9/2026-08/7018545d-d2a3-4047-a537-8bacd236f689.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a5fa77b46d2ecb18af59e9bd34feaf48/2026-08/a2207412-3091-4ff2-b244-8cff8328753b.jpg\"/><img alt=\"馬房大合照\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/26ff958a02222ad0d1627f01ec28f895/2026-08/b07489f5-1e99-4da5-806e-fb223aee6565_1_.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5a97e981f2cbc7a280c31ba7e751c640/2026-08/bb5fa0c3-0f28-4ec5-8cfd-0cbdd0d97e66.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0987af5d836950836e5cd5327071437b/2026-08/df914ecc-8584-42c4-990b-91e9c87daa14.jpg\"/><p>陳嘉甜</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-22T08:19:16.570493+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":289,"images":10,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}